[CENTER]
[SIZE=7][B][COLOR=#2C3E50]LeafRTP[/COLOR][COLOR=#2980B9]-Pro[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#555555]High-Performance Random Teleport (RTP) Plugin for Folia, Paper & Spigot[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[I]The fastest Folia-native random teleport plugin - instant /rtp, safe landings, multi-server / proxy support, and audited safety.[/I]
[I]Supported: Paper, Folia, Spigot, Fabric (Arclight / Mohist for Forge / NeoForge) - Minecraft 1.20.x / 1.21.x / 26.x.[/I]
[I]For operators who edit YAML, version-control configs, and read profiler output. Drop-in upgrade from the free LeafRTP build.[/I]
