[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#27AE60]Why operators buy Pro[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[CENTER][SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#27AE60]19.8 TP/s sustained at 4 ms worst-case tick. Next-best plugin: 70 ms.[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[B]If [I]/rtp[/I] is the top entry in your timings report, this is the fix.[/B] LeafRTP-Pro is the polygon-bounded, Folia-native Random Teleport engine for high-load and custom-world Minecraft servers:

[LIST]
[*][B]No lag spikes when players spam [I]/rtp[/I].[/B] Worst-case main-thread tick stays at 4 ms (vs. 70-771 ms for the next plugins) - your TPS holds at 20.00 during a teleport burst.
[*][B]Instant teleports, no "Finding a safe location..." wait.[/B] Pre-verified location queue serves [I]/rtp[/I] in one tick instead of loading chunks on demand.
[*][B]The only LeafRTP plugin that runs natively on Folia at double-digit TP/s[/B] (9.87 TP/s @ 99.97 % success) - every competitor stalls regions or fails to load.
[*][B]Automatic performance the moment the jar drops in.[/B] Pre-warmed location queue, persistent spatial memory, off-tick Anvil pre-filter and async chunk loading kick in on first start - no profiling, no tuning, no per-world hand-holding. Same [I]config.yml[/I], commands, and claim-plugin integrations (GriefDefender, GriefPrevention, Lands, WorldGuard, Towny, Factions, HuskTowns, RedProtect) as the free build, so the upgrade itself is risk-free.
[*][B]Audited safety[/B]: no unsafe blocks, no force-loaded chunks, no claim-bypassing teleports, no silent failures (REQ-RTP-S-001..S-007).
[/LIST]

